6.3 Referential Integrity
Every evidence.link_id must exist in cross_subject_link.

Every link_relation.link_id and link_relation.related_link_id must exist in cross_subject_link.

Every method_link.link_id_ref must exist in cross_subject_link.

Every learning_link.link_id_ref must exist in cross_subject_link.

Every provenance.link_id must exist in cross_subject_link.

Every moderation.link_id must exist in cross_subject_link.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The link relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

